<a class="dh-pop-link" href="https://shopify.com/{{ shop.id }}/account/orders">Orders <svg class="dh-pop-ext" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4h6v6"/><path d="M20 4 11 13"/><path d="M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"/></svg></a>
